ounced \"まり\".\n\n\"Nice to meet you, I'm Marie! I used to live in the mountains, but all the elders were cramping my style. Down here, I can dress fashionably and eat as much as I want!\"\n\n\"Talents? I can huff and puff super hard!\"\n\n\"Interests? I like prowling for new restaurants!\"\n\nPlease attempt this tongue twister. If you attempt and fail, I would enjoy a recording of that as well. But if you do it on the first try, don't force yourself to fail, haha.\n\n\"裏庭には二羽庭には二羽鶏がいる. Sounds yummy...\"\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/nSYoWvi", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@niui_3/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1153526, "client_id": 702836, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/7ba74cb2-d0bd-44ae-a57c-f69c912a0c67?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1782397813&Signature=ZOC9DOVNIz61DXfULWoyR2kKSbN-9P3LSUDxQEVnfr16b18o1jEr7UancTF-Je6u4Cr4~rrGFoAVRz5zZM1HT2F4yCrq3GUhnjqljM4WqEPRmiQYdFuPtDwBz9kB2RvtdQKl1-GRCBsoiSQnw8HL8sbOT4rogz8x17IkRbVojqKbSbJdM4fYmDMtzt5HWiKQIP7qOza-yXrP9EVpj8dbSjUxr1dkD3tTCh0jEHNirztKL0NvAv0NmFImD-Pweb-d~mL0Bb1ZbvbliwCfBTHT3P~zDeCIB6191EWI4aEtzRIfqN759fz03TAnqDmb3MInMQdt--z-WFs9qHa9bjMVcg__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2038255679778299904%2FXZsT37lh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ef919d2427277c8e8ccdae28b9c9b52", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2038255679778299904%2FXZsT37lh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ef919d2427277c8e8ccdae28b9c9b52, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2038255679778299904%2FXZsT37lh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f81